{"audio": "romans-06.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 164267, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1600, "text": "Romans, Chapter Six."}, {"start_ms": 1600, "end_ms": 3200, "text": "What shall we say then?"}, {"start_ms": 3200, "end_ms": 6400, "text": "Shall we continue in sin, that grace may abound?"}, {"start_ms": 6400, "end_ms": 7200, "text": "God forbid."}, {"start_ms": 7200, "end_ms": 11600, "text": "How shall we, that are dead to sin, live any longer therein?"}, {"start_ms": 11600, "end_ms": 18000, "text": "Know ye not, that so many of us as were baptized into Jesus Christ were baptized into his death?"}, {"start_ms": 18000, "end_ms": 29600, "text": "Therefore we are buried with him by baptism into death: that like as Christ was raised up from the dead by the glory of the Father, even so we also should walk in newness of life."}, {"start_ms": 29600, "end_ms": 44667, "text": "For if we have been planted together in the likeness of his death, we shall be also in the likeness of his resurrection: Knowing this, that our old man is crucified with him, that the body of sin might be destroyed, that henceforth we should not serve sin."}, {"start_ms": 44667, "end_ms": 48000, "text": "For he that is dead is freed from sin."}, {"start_ms": 48000, "end_ms": 58400, "text": "Now if we be dead with Christ, we believe that we shall also live with him: Knowing that Christ being raised from the dead dieth no more; death hath no more dominion over him."}, {"start_ms": 58400, "end_ms": 65067, "text": "For in that he died, he died unto sin once: but in that he liveth, he liveth unto God."}, {"start_ms": 65067, "end_ms": 72533, "text": "Likewise reckon ye also yourselves to be dead indeed unto sin, but alive unto God through Jesus Christ our Lord."}, {"start_ms": 72533, "end_ms": 77733, "text": "Let not sin therefore reign in your mortal body, that ye should obey it in the lusts thereof."}, {"start_ms": 77733, "end_ms": 89867, "text": "Neither yield ye your members as instruments of unrighteousness unto sin: but yield yourselves unto God, as those that are alive from the dead, and your members as instruments of righteousness unto God."}, {"start_ms": 89867, "end_ms": 95600, "text": "For sin shall not have dominion over you: for ye are not under the law, but under grace."}, {"start_ms": 95600, "end_ms": 96400, "text": "What then?"}, {"start_ms": 96400, "end_ms": 100400, "text": "shall we sin, because we are not under the law, but under grace?"}, {"start_ms": 100400, "end_ms": 101200, "text": "God forbid."}, {"start_ms": 101200, "end_ms": 111733, "text": "Know ye not, that to whom ye yield yourselves servants to obey, his servants ye are to whom ye obey; whether of sin unto death, or of obedience unto righteousness?"}, {"start_ms": 111733, "end_ms": 120800, "text": "But God be thanked, that ye were the servants of sin, but ye have obeyed from the heart that form of doctrine which was delivered you."}, {"start_ms": 120800, "end_ms": 125067, "text": "Being then made free from sin, ye became the servants of righteousness."}, {"start_ms": 125067, "end_ms": 138933, "text": "I speak after the manner of men because of the infirmity of your flesh: for as ye have yielded your members servants to uncleanness and to iniquity unto iniquity; even so now yield your members servants to righteousness unto holiness."}, {"start_ms": 138933, "end_ms": 143067, "text": "For when ye were the servants of sin, ye were free from righteousness."}, {"start_ms": 143067, "end_ms": 147067, "text": "What fruit had ye then in those things whereof ye are now ashamed?"}, {"start_ms": 147067, "end_ms": 149467, "text": "for the end of those things is death."}, {"start_ms": 149467, "end_ms": 157867, "text": "But now being made free from sin, and become servants to God, ye have your fruit unto holiness, and the end everlasting life."}, {"start_ms": 157867, "end_ms": 164267, "text": "For the wages of sin is death; but the gift of God is eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord."}], "words": [{"t": "Romans,", "s": 405, "e": 810, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 891, "e": 1235, "si": 0}, {"t": "Six.", "s": 1296, "e": 1519, "si": 0}, {"t": "What", "s": 2005, "e": 2167, "si": 1}, {"t": "shall", "s": 2248, "e": 2430, "si": 1}, {"t": "we", "s": 2471, "e": 2532, "si": 1}, {"t": "say", "s": 2653, "e": 2835, "si": 1}, {"t": "then?", "s": 2896, "e": 3099, "si": 1}, {"t": "Shall", "s": 3643, "e": 3784, "si": 2}, {"t": "we", "s": 3804, "e": 3864, "si": 2}, {"t": "continue", "s": 3904, "e": 4408, "si": 2}, {"t": "in", "s": 4448, "e": 4508, "si": 2}, {"t": "sin,", "s": 4649, "e": 4911, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 5233, "e": 5353, "si": 2}, {"t": "grace", "s": 5414, "e": 5696, "si": 2}, {"t": "may", "s": 5736, "e": 5836, "si": 2}, {"t": "abound?", "s": 5877, "e": 6259, "si": 2}, {"t": "God", "s": 6646, "e": 6790, "si": 3}, {"t": "forbid.", "s": 6831, "e": 7200, "si": 3}, {"t": "How", "s": 7642, "e": 7783, "si": 4}, {"t": "shall", "s": 7843, "e": 8044, "si": 4}, {"t": "we,", "s": 8104, "e": 8205, "si": 4}, {"t": "that", "s": 8707, "e": 8847, "si": 4}, {"t": "are", "s": 8888, "e": 9008, "si": 4}, {"t": "dead", "s": 9068, "e": 9269, "si": 4}, {"t": "to", "s": 9330, "e": 9410, "si": 4}, {"t": "sin,", "s": 9551, "e": 9812, "si": 4}, {"t": "live", "s": 10133, "e": 10435, "si": 4}, {"t": "any", "s": 10495, "e": 10636, "si": 4}, {"t": "longer", "s": 10736, "e": 11078, "si": 4}, {"t": "therein?", "s": 11138, "e": 11500, "si": 4}, {"t": "Know", "s": 12041, "e": 12202, "si": 5}, {"t": "ye", "s": 12262, "e": 12342, "si": 5}, {"t": "not,", "s": 12443, "e": 12724, "si": 5}, {"t": "that", "s": 12904, "e": 13045, "si": 5}, {"t": "so", "s": 13185, "e": 13285, "si": 5}, {"t": "many", "s": 13406, "e": 13626, "si": 5}, {"t": "of", "s": 13727, "e": 13807, "si": 5}, {"t": "us", "s": 13887, "e": 14028, "si": 5}, {"t": "as", "s": 14108, "e": 14208, "si": 5}, {"t": "were", "s": 14228, "e": 14369, "si": 5}, {"t": "baptized", "s": 14409, "e": 15031, "si": 5}, {"t": "into",